          "Restart same history",
          "Require explicit reassertion of the qualified identity, except the explicitly retried persistent pin below. Retain all admission and liveness fences."
        ],
        [
          "Fresh",
          "Separate explicit intent. Do not delete the old transcript or automatically replay its message."
        ],
        [
          "auto_resume_on_restart = false",
          "Allow the configured-Fresh manual launch/restart, not a substitution by an automatic wake/send."
        ],
        [
          "Persistent/spent pins",
          "A persistent Use pin may explicitly retry the same qualified target. A spent pin requires a new assertion. A fork is spent at dispatch. No new automatic retry loop."
